    <title>021# 北京欢迎我（省钱版）【看那花花世界系列·北京】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680e45d18aed253fa3db253c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">680e45d18aed253fa3db253c</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 29 Apr 2025 10:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目请到一对情侣刚去完北京回来，在没有刻意节约的情况下，超省的玩转北京，各大景点，包括环球影城...其中的小技巧和小门路着实让主播们大开眼界。强烈推荐适合初次到北京自由行的朋友们记笔记！</span><br><span>本期为拖更节目是去年11月录制，尚在保质期，放心恰！</span></p><span></span><p><span>首先声明：无广无广无广！（但需要，感恩各位金主打赏🙏）</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望大家听得高兴，花得最少玩的最花！</span></p><span></span><p><span>------</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Highlights：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="156">02:36</a> DAY 1 - 国家博物馆、天安门降旗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="463">07:43</a> DAY 2 - 环球影城&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1456">24:16</a> DAY 3 - 毛主席、故宫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1721">28:41</a> DAY 4 - 长城、鸟巢、牛街、德云社（其实在第一天）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2000">33:20</a> DAY 5 - 天坛、铜锅涮肉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2094">34:54</a> DAY 6 - 雍和宫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2345">39:05</a> 吃点啥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2729">45:29</a> 住在哪</span></p><span></span><p><span>------</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BMG：</span></strong><br><span>New Boy - 朴树</span><br><span>国际歌 - 唐朝乐队</span><br><span>那些花儿 - 朴树</span><br><span>五环之歌 - 岳云鹏/MC HotDog热狗</span><br><span>北京欢迎你 - 谭晶</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：居居 </span><br><span>主播：啧啧、芥末</span></p><span></span><p><span>谢谢你这么好看还关注我们！</span></p>]]></description>
