    <guid isPermaLink="false">67e943738eecdbeb6013cc39</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 31 Mar 2025 10:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目请到一位从异国恋晋升到异国婚姻的Jessica老师，与我们谈谈如何突破远距离、异国、年龄差等重重难关，将这段长达11年的长跑亲密关系稳步走到今天。本期为拖更节目录制于去年，虽迟但到！</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望大家听得开心，感受生活多样性！</span></p><span></span><p><span>Highlights：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="136">02:16</a> 相识相见相恋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="972">16:12</a> 以结婚为目标的恋爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1594">26:34</a> 远赴异国的生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1857">30:57</a> 孩子的成长选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2474">41:14</a> 大叔印象二三事</span></p><span></span><p><span>BMG：</span></p><span></span><p><span>有不错的人就介绍下吧 - Rumble Fish</span></p><span></span><p><span>春雪 - 10cm</span></p><span></span><p><span>少女 - 吴赫</span></p><span></span><p><span>致犹豫的恋人 - Jannabi</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：Jessica，Ginna，Sherley</span><br><span>主播：啧啧</span></p><span></span><p><span>谢谢你这么好看还关注我们！</span></p>]]></description>
