  <item>
    <title>019#与ONE OK ROCK的东京之约【特种兵追星】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/672a4ffbb2eb246ec4f1e752</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">672a4ffbb2eb246ec4f1e752</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 05 Nov 2024 23:23:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目我们聊聊第一次追日巡是怎样的体验！关于我与ONE OK ROCK不得不说的二三事，从去年10月hk中环的小犬之痛，到12月OOR亚博的卷土重来，第一次看演唱会甩手甩到乳酸堆积，再到中秋直冲日本的世巡东京之约!</span></p><span></span><p><span>芥末：剪完发现想说的话好像还有很多没有说完，罗里吧嗦的介绍了一堆，但总之总之，这次日巡是很不容易的，冲动的，快乐的，感动的，幸福的，人生不可多得的经历，我会永远记得这个秋天，记得OOR在味之素体育馆给我带来的感动，也会记得每个遇见的可爱的OORer们！我永远喜欢OOR！！！（个人取向非常严重的一期）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Highlights：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="74">01:14</a> &nbsp;去看谁的演唱会？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="157">02:37</a> 啊 是初心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="384">06:24</a> 特种兵追星的契机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="432">07:12</a> 演唱会票抽选辛酸史&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1564">26:04</a> 演唱会开始啦！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgQfbwkzcQkmdS4oM8QbojwUhkxx.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi0f7x2auTttisYJqwoc4-7p-fqB.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmT5_SexhvXgJ_qepM8ub2G-fVE3.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmoZAzTPyHgci2PlpcU7txAK9qMj.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtHzh8XXlWUCPCK98BTDCr98Erp8.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq5M5stVpUUbOTd-XUXGY-81hn-U.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>BMG：</span></p><span></span><p><span>I Was King - ONE OK ROCK</span></p><span></span><p><span>WE ARE - ONE OK ROCK</span></p><span></span><p><span>Wasted Nights - ONE OK ROCK</span></p><span></span><p><span>好听的歌太多咯 &nbsp;所以！!</span></p><span></span><p><span>↓↓↓ 指路移步本人精选OOR歌单</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a data-url="http://163cn.tv/yPOXyqM" href="http://163cn.tv/yPOXyqM">163cn.tv</a> 】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：啧啧，芥末</span></p><span></span><p><span>谢谢你这么好看还关注我们！</span></p>]]></description>
