    <guid isPermaLink="false">671610530d2f24f289b0251c</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 21 Oct 2024 12:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期录制时间是一年前的十月，虽迟但到！同样是十一出行，同样是令人心驰神往的朝拜圣地---西藏，最为闻名的川藏线也曾一度成为自驾摩旅骑行爱好者的追逐与热爱，这一趟文艺者的狂热之路，也是发现自然壮丽与神秘的澎湃之行。和本期嘉宾一起唠唠独自去西藏的旅程，经历了什么样的心灵洗礼和人生感触。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望大家听得peace，借着耳朵路过世界！</span></p><span></span><p><span>------</span></p><span></span><p><span>Highlights：</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="243">04:03</a> 独自上路的前期准备</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="581">09:41</a> 拉萨</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1912">31:52</a> 纳木措</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2179">36:19</a> 灵芝 巴松措</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2532">42:12</a> 旅行的意义</span></p><span></span><p><span>------</span></p><span></span><p><span>BMG：</span><br><span>七分钟的机会 - Bad Sweetheart</span><br><span>Supermoon - Summer Salt</span><br><span>Paradise...How Far? - The Chairs</span></p><span></span><p><span>------</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：老王</span><br><span>主播：啧啧</span><br><span>谢谢你这么好看还关注我们！</span></p>]]></description>
