  <item>
    <title>013# 去京都能不逛寺庙吗？【看那花花世界系列·日本关西】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6592ef41ce7b77ef72c28192</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6592ef41ce7b77ef72c28192</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 15 Jan 2024 10:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>接上期内容，本期详谈日本（主打关西，浅谈东京）火热景点玩法和路上趣事儿～不能错过的奈良喂小鹿，踏遍京都寺庙却都在看人，冬日温泉得泡金汤银汤......首次踏入日本，可以这么玩儿～</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望大家听的开心，借着耳朵看世界！</span></p><span></span><p><span>Highlights：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="18">00:18</a> 去奈良谈恋爱吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="384">06:24</a> 去京都晃晃膀子</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="625">10:25</a> 和服体验</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="749">12:29</a> 清水寺&amp;二三年坂</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="885">14:45</a> 岚山</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="981">16:21</a> 东映太秦映画村</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1458">24:18</a> 有马温泉&amp;六甲山</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1392">23:12</a> 克制的购物欲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1923">32:03</a> 游玩小tips</span></p><span></span><p><span>------</span></p><span></span><p><span>啧啧老师的10日关西行程单（适合首次，去走马观花版）</span></p><span></span><p><span>D1-大阪（道顿堀/心斋桥）</span></p><span></span><p><span>D2-大阪（USJ）</span></p><span></span><p><span>D3-大阪（P1.闲逛：Orange street/美国村/按摩；P2.大阪周游卡：大阪城/天守阁/新世界/通天阁/梅田空中花园/hep five摩天轮/船游道顿堀）</span></p><span></span><p><span>D4-奈良（东大寺/奈良公园/春日大社/若草山）不过夜</span></p><span></span><p><span>D5-京都-和服体验（P1.慈照寺/哲学之道/禅林寺/南禅寺/清水寺；P2.清水寺/二三年坂/八坂神社/祗园/鸭川）</span></p><span></span><p><span>D6-京都-岚山（竹林之道/野宫神社/常寂光寺/天龙寺/渡月桥/猴子山）-京都东映太秦映画村</span></p><span></span><p><span>D7-京都（锦市场/伏见稻荷大社/宇治）</span></p><span></span><p><span>D8-兵库（有马温泉/六甲山）</span></p><span></span><p><span>D9-大阪（友都八喜/大丸百货/hep five/阪急/阪神...）购物就对了</span></p><span></span><p><span>D10-返程</span></p><span></span><p><span>------</span></p><span></span><p><span>BMG：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Tamaki - RADWIMPS</span></p><span></span><p><span>クリスマスソング - back number</span></p><span></span><p><span>First Love - 宇多田光</span></p><span></span><p><span>蕾 - コブクロ</span></p><span></span><p><span>------</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：啧啧，芥末，十三香</span></p><span></span><p><span>谢谢你这么好看还关注我们！</span></p>]]></description>
