  <item>
    <title>012# USJ不完全指南【看那花花世界系列·日本关西】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6592db5a6396a4645a6c26f2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6592db5a6396a4645a6c26f2</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 2024 15:33:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>作为刚从核污水考察之旅返回的啧啧老师，一秒入坑了成年人的乐园。本期节目乘热打铁，给出最新的攻略和游玩建议，趁着这个冬季还未结束，让我们畅谈第一次去日本（主打关西，浅谈东京）应该怎么玩才带劲儿～</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望大家听的轻松，借着耳朵看世界！</span></p><span></span><p><span>Highlights：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a> 日本环球影城 攻略tips</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="881">14:41</a> 大阪&amp;京都 美食推介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1458">24:18</a> 大阪住宿&amp;游玩tips</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1600">26:40</a> 有马温泉小趣事</span></p><span></span><p><span>------</span></p><span></span><p><span>好吃的：</span></p><span></span><p><span>【大阪】一澜拉面、渔火(300円均一)、Kyushu Ramen Kio Dotombori(拉面)【京都】国产牛肉(放题)、Tai Sushi、Torisei Shijo Kiyamachi(烧鸟店，有好喝的梅子酒，要加苏打哦～)</span></p><span></span><p><span>好住的：</span></p><span></span><p><span>【大阪】难波/梅田、【京都】三条通/四条通、【有马】雷亚罗浮卡库酒店</span></p><span></span><p><span>好玩的：</span></p><span></span><p><span>【USJ】购买的快速通4项：马力欧卡丁车+哈利波特+飞天翼龙+蜘蛛侠</span></p><span></span><p><span>------</span></p><span></span><p><span>BMG：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Rain - 秦基博</span></p><span></span><p><span>ヴィーナス・モーニング - さいとうまりな</span></p><span></span><p><span>Wherever you are - one ok rock</span></p><span></span><p><span>------</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：啧啧，芥末，十三香</span></p><span></span><p><span>谢谢你这么好看还关注我们！</span></p>]]></description>
