  <item>
    <title>011# ♐️射手座=幸运体质？【星座特辑】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/658463ee3d1caa927aee617c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">658463ee3d1caa927aee617c</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 21 Dec 2023 16:12:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一个被木星守护的射手座，关键词：乐观，冒险，自由。本期节目我们来听听这个不时就听说好运常相伴的射手座朋友的故事，以及业余占星师旭仔老师的浅谈解读。所有不能解答的问题，好像总能在玄学中不了了之。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望大家听得一乐，放平心态，不盲目迷信！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【迷信玄学，信则有不信则无】</span></p><span></span><p><span>【不建议未成年人饮酒哦～请在家长的陪同下收听😊】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Highlights：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="331">05:31</a> 没点运气 可爬不了印尼爬火山</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">09:40</a> 这也能卖车？（无广）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="886">14:46</a> 发家致富需要有点小聪明（真的没有拿到咸鱼广告）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1205">20:05</a> 请勿盲目迷信 注意用火（还是无广）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1408">23:28</a> 悲观的乐观主义者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a> 跑起来 才能有一缕清风</span></p><span></span><p><span>------</span></p><span></span><p><span>BMG：</span></p><span></span><p><span>我想part2 - 法老/杨秋儒</span></p><span></span><p><span>而家到咗夏天未 - 灵山村帮/邓乐怡</span></p><span></span><p><span>返乡下耕田啦你 - 林海峰</span></p><span></span><p><span>Supermoon - Summer Salt</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：爱辣，旭仔，dd</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：啧啧</span></p><span></span><p><span>谢谢你这么好看还关注我们！一键三连，让我们感知彼此的温度！</span></p>]]></description>
