    <pubDate>Tue, 12 Dec 2023 08:21:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>继上次浅谈过对社交软件交友的普遍看法后，本期节目找到了新朋友来现身说法，详谈下在互联网遇到过的形形色色的妖魔鬼怪，恋爱脑是如何斩妖除魔，逃离魔掌，爬出泥泞沼泽，穿越荆棘丛林，找到了自己的春天。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望大家听得顺畅，大胆say no！勇敢去爱！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【由于本期户外录音，收听效果欠佳，请见谅】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【人物故事如有雷同，纯属巧合】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Highlights：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> 好厉害的“光荣事迹”，but，过去了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="710">11:50</a> 没想到不仅个儿高，玩的也花</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1270">21:10</a> 兄deí，能不能把手從我腰上拿走？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1510">25:10</a> “纯情害羞“的一八三男孩</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播都意外的后续跟进</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1902">31:42</a> 铁树开花花</span></p><span></span><p><span>------</span></p><span></span><p><span>BMG：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Baby Powder - Jenevieve</span></p><span></span><p><span>Problems - DeathbyRomy</span></p><span></span><p><span>Photo ID - Remi Wolf &amp; Dominic Fike</span></p><span></span><p><span>Mama's Boy - Dominic Fike</span></p><span></span><p><span>Real Eyes - Pae Arak &amp; Numcha</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：某某，Ginna</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：啧啧</span></p><span></span><p><span>谢谢你这么好看还关注我们！一键三连，让我们感知彼此的温度！</span></p>]]></description>
