  <item>
    <title>009# 大理太安逸了 我要回去搬砖！【看那花花世界系列·大理】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64de08043fa4090b74863285</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64de08043fa4090b74863285</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 17 Aug 2023 11:44:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目趁着这个暑假的旅游旺季还未结束，我们来聊聊大家呼声最高的，最向往生活的地方---云南大理。芥末老师有幸在6月也去放松了一下，让我们交流下彼此对那里的印象与旅游推介～</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望大家听的轻松，借着耳朵看世界！</span></p><span></span><p><span>Highlights：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="220">03:40</a> 去了哪里？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="524">08:44</a> 路上遇到有趣的人与事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 推荐好玩点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1296">21:36</a> 推荐好吃点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1720">28:40</a> 下一次想怎么玩?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1836">30:36</a> 旅行的意义</span></p><span></span><p><span>------</span></p><span></span><p><span>好住的：</span><a href="https://m.dianping.com/shopshare/l7bJLHwFPREBps5O?msource=Appshare2021&amp;utm_source=shop_share&amp;issilencelogin=0&amp;shareid=myC306vOFU_1692246703" data-url="https://m.dianping.com/shopshare/l7bJLHwFPREBps5O?msource=Appshare2021&amp;utm_source=shop_share&amp;issilencelogin=0&amp;shareid=myC306vOFU_1692246703"><span>猫米花园</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://m.dianping.com/shopshare/F1aLmWApcMtWUBed?msource=Appshare2021&amp;utm_source=shop_share&amp;issilencelogin=0&amp;shareid=PVjVKemhhe_1692246540" data-url="https://m.dianping.com/shopshare/F1aLmWApcMtWUBed?msource=Appshare2021&amp;utm_source=shop_share&amp;issilencelogin=0&amp;shareid=PVjVKemhhe_1692246540"><span>吾乡间</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://m.dianping.com/shopshare/k5U8SUHoBwjhV2by?msource=Appshare2021&amp;utm_source=shop_share&amp;issilencelogin=0&amp;shareid=pzE4xtgxTI_1692246569" data-url="https://m.dianping.com/shopshare/k5U8SUHoBwjhV2by?msource=Appshare2021&amp;utm_source=shop_share&amp;issilencelogin=0&amp;shareid=pzE4xtgxTI_1692246569"><span>六阅</span></a><span>、松赞</span></p><span></span><p><span>好吃的：</span><a href="https://m.dianping.com/sh