    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目我们来聊聊我们所听过和相处过的室友们。漫漫人生路，总会遇到几个特别的人，也因为特别的缘分（可能是孽缘）更是成为了室友，赶快来听听朝夕相处下的不吐不快的故事吧~</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望大家听得开心，住得顺心~</span></p><span></span><p><span>Highlights：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 看你乱花钱他就开心的室友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="550">09:10</a> 聚餐总是装胃痛提前离席的室友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 很有自己精神世界的室友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="842">14:02</a> 各自安好的室友vs不问自拿的室友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 沉迷游戏暴瘦的室友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1241">20:41</a> 对床室友是情敌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1350">22:30</a> 想把你掰弯的室友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1536">25:36</a> 在宿舍种“植物”的室友</span></p><span></span><p><span>BMG：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Mr.Blue Sky- Electric Light Orchestra</span></p><span></span><p><span>看你交的什么朋友 - 万玲琳</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：啧啧，芥末</span></p><span></span><p><span>谢谢你这么好看还关注我们！</span></p>]]></description>
